# Probes the Python reference route (`python3 -m unisa run`, difftest-py) gets wrong while the C
# reference and the shipped product pass them; same contract as tests/difftest.knownfail (a listed
# probe that starts passing fails the suite).  Opened 2026-10-05.
f1_ctor_dtor python run drops __attribute__((constructor/destructor)): prints main 0 (C reference and product: main 12 / bye 12)
h1_block_extern python run does not bind a block-scope extern to the file-scope object: prints 0 0 16777200 16777200 (C reference and product: 5 11 3 7)
